-- Example: Annotations in L4
-- Demonstrates @desc, @nlg, and @ref annotations

§ `Example: Annotations in L4`
    GIVEN `person age` IS A NUMBER

GIVETH A NUMBER
`age next year` MEANS `person age` PLUS 1

@nlg "the applicant's age"

@ref "Section 4(1)(a) of the Act"

#EVAL `age next year` WITH `person age` IS 41
